{"parse": {"title": "FT-19", "pageid": 55373, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-18\" title=\"FT-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-19</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-20\" title=\"FT-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">19</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BB.92.E4.B8.9D.E5.B8.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"绒丝带\">绒丝带</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 绒丝带</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Velvet Ribbon</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>曾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>系<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>细<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010119</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>够了，我才不在乎你说什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>我宁愿死在外面，也不要在这里发臭！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门被狠狠踹出一个洞，打了开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你就想跟那帮政府的老爷搭上伙，是吗？嗯？你以为他们会拿正眼瞧你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>他们会把你当作最底层、最微不足道的“填线兵”，放到远比街头厮杀更不择手段的斗争里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他气势汹汹地走过去，就像一位不容置疑的父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你以为我拦住那群狗腿子找到你，都是为了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你呆在这儿，或者呆在任何除了圣洛夫基金会以外的任何地方，我都举一万双手同意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>只要你不去那儿，不管是大学、公司、医院……你能比任何人都过得更好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她合上行李箱，突然发自内心地笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>“能比任何人都过得更好”，瞧瞧你，哥哥，多么令人发笑的愿景？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>你终于把你的心底话说出来了，是吗？助人为乐、济困扶危，好邻居，好老大——J？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>你把我看得太低了！我才没有兴趣把我的利益置于别人的苟延残喘之上，我有远比你、我，整条海特街，都更高的理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>它不会因为任何人而消磨、折损。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他冷笑着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>可等你深陷危险，谁又会来搭救你？那帮愣头愣脑的白袍子吗？把心肝卖给所谓理想，而非身边的挚友、亲人的圣洛夫基金会职员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我打赌，总有一天，你会哭哭啼啼地回来，告诉我原来外面的世界并不是那么回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>等到那时候，就轮到我捧腹大笑了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望向了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>笑吧，笑吧……J。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>人是愿意忍受痛苦，人也是愿意死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>如果我会死，那是出于我的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>到那时候，我所保护的就是所有人，而那也是我应该付出的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的面容不再戏谑，靠在墙上，深长地叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我们到底是什么时候走出了两条路的，妹妹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>从你把那个欺骗了我的巫毒师……揍得沿街乞讨开始，就因为他嘲笑我是人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>……这是一场困局，哥哥。第一个人折磨第二个人，第二个人教予第三个人……无休无止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>我找到了我的答案，而我现在准备试错……你或许能阻拦一场酒后斗殴，一次危机，但你知道你阻止不了我的意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她推开被踹出破洞的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我的摩托车坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>我可以坐灰狗巴士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我说，今天他们不开张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>那我就走过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>走到我的目的地为止。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jiufangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jiufangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-309415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咳、咳……噗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达挡在他的身前，岿然不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黏稠的血从牙缝里流出来，淌到地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他感觉到每动弹一下，深入骨髓的疼痛就蹿过全身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>好了，这个高傲的金发小妞……你准备好当标本了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手无寸铁的恐惧，正在缓缓爬上身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>作为圣洛夫基金会的特派调查员玛蒂尔达·布翁尼，我有义务保护所有的普通人，即便需要以我的生命为代价！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音在打颤，她的双脚在发软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是第一防线学校曾在课堂上教予过她的责任。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>玛蒂尔达，当你真正面对他们的时候……告诉我，你是否有与死亡站在同一侧的勇气?</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>你真的准备好，作为外派调查员，加入基金会了吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我会倾尽所有的力量保护所有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我不会辱没千百年来布翁尼家族的荣誉与尊严。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_zhansunj1\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_zhansunj1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼皮犹如挂上了锁链，将他的意识往下拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的余光，瞥见尖锐的蛇尾，于半空中挥舞、摆动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>单薄的小身躯，矗立在他身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他好像又看见那条蓝丝带，从他眼前飘过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从肺腑中，发出了最后的呐喊。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_zhansunj2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_zhansunj2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0f/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"860\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"480\" data-file-height=\"688\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>快点走，傻家伙……我不需要你挡在我面前，更不需要你把命搭在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我才不在乎你们基金会的那套使命，那套冠冕堂皇的价值观——我**不在乎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你不明白，如果你真的死了，像霍利克一样死在这里……那这一切……你所经历的一切，就真的……没有了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>咳、咳……去跟你的上头汇报，说这一切只是一个不遵守保密协定的家伙自讨苦吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>告诉他们，是那个顽固不化的傻大个站错了队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>你完成了你理应要做的事情，没有谁有资格责怪你……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_at_zhansunj1\"><img alt=\"2_0_at_zhansunj1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_at_zhansunj1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304115.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-304115.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304115.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304115.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-304115.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304115.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-304115.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304115.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我不接受你的提议……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-304112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>——我会站在这里，直到支援到来为止！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她瑟瑟发抖的手，紧紧握成了拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>只要逃跑就好了，咳、咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>别管任何人就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>人是愿意忍受痛苦，人也是愿意死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>如果我会死，那是出于我的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-626501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">保利娜：</div><div>……而那也是我应该付出的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>如果有选择的话，我希望你成为另一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你从来不是生在一个支离破碎的家庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你拥有一张舒适的床榻，有一个更加温馨且奢侈的屋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你成为另一个被父母珍爱的、笨手笨脚的富家女孩，所有人都以你为傲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你不用管世界上的贫穷与苦痛，疾病与战争……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你的窗户永远不会破损，暖炉的火焰一直烧到天亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你从不住在我为你布置的破狗窝里，我希望你从不会有受人嘲笑的破旧衣裳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望你身边永远是大方而忠诚的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我希望……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">J：</div><div>我从来不是你的哥哥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他们在这里！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-19"}}